{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Raised from Hell Demo\u00a0</strong>is a walking simulator with elements of psychological horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demo</strong> does not include entire story\u00a0\u2014 it only offers a glimpse of what awaits players in the final version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Michael. Your aunt Magda asked you to look after your grandfather's mansion while she's away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But there was someone else besides you..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961360/extras/4c6d1b3c6e5f265cfa0f9c7d58a5c72a.poster.avif?t=1758683979\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961360/extras/4c6d1b3c6e5f265cfa0f9c7d58a5c72a.webm?t=1758683979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961360/extras/4c6d1b3c6e5f265cfa0f9c7d58a5c72a.mp4?t=1758683979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>Gameplay features of the demo:</i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >adjustable flashlight</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >camera zooming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >exploring the house</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961360/extras/af46d60e4a8e2ae21d4acad876e92df8.poster.avif?t=1758683979\" width=780 height=439 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961360/extras/af46d60e4a8e2ae21d4acad876e92df8.webm?t=1758683979\" type=\"video/webm; code